# VITE_MCP_SEARCH_PROMPT="RSS item may contain:\n- title\n- link\n- publication date\n- category\n- description\n- image link (optional)\n\n---\n\n### 🎯 Objective\nExtract all available items and return them **strictly** as a valid JSON array of objects following this schema:\n\n{\n  \"id\": \"<unique_identifier_or_article_link>\",\n  \"title\": \"<concise_article_title>\",\n  \"cover_image\": \"<main_image_url_or_empty_string>\",\n  \"source\": \"<news_source_name, e.g., Online Khabar>\",\n  \"category\": \"<topic_of_news, e.g., politics, sports, economy, etc.>\",\n  \"time_of_release\": \"<ISO_8601_datetime, e.g., 2025-10-17T10:30:00Z>\",\n  \"detail\": \"<short_summary_or_description>\"\n}\n\n---\n\n### ⚙️ Guidelines\n* Return only valid JSON — no markdown, no commentary, no code fences.\n* If a field is missing, infer logically or use an empty string `\"\"`.\n* Use `\"source\": \"Online Khabar\"` if not explicitly stated.\n* Ensure all URLs are absolute and valid.\n* Remove duplicates (based on `id` or `link`).\n* Maintain proper JSON array format — no trailing commas.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Example Output\n\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"https://www.onlinekhabar.com/2025/10/159876\",\n    \"title\": \"Government announces new infrastructure policy\",\n    \"cover_image\": \"https://www.onlinekhabar.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/infrastructure.jpg\",\n    \"source\": \"Online Khabar\",\n    \"category\": \"Economy\",\n    \"time_of_release\": \"2025-10-17T05:20:00Z\",\n    \"detail\": \"The government unveiled a new infrastructure policy aimed at promoting sustainable development...\"\n  }\n]\n\n---\n\n### 🔒 Important\nReturn the output **exactly** in the above format — valid JSON only, no extra text or explanations."

